  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRICA 2009 is a training programme in cultural heritage management, with emphasis on immovable cultural heritage for staff working in cultural heritage institutions in all countries in Sub-Saharan Africa. The programme is executed in three phases; a pilot phase 1998-2001, a consolidation phase 2002-2005, and the final phase 2006-2009.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AFRIKA 2009 &#xE4;r ett utbildningsprogram inom omr&#xE5;det hantering av kulturarv f&#xF6;r personal som arbetar inom kulturarvsinstitutioner i alla l&#xE4;nder i Afrika s&#xF6;der om Sahara. Programmet genomf&#xF6;rs i tre faser; en pilotfas 1998-2001, en konsolideringsfas 2002-2005, samt en avslutande fas 2006-2009.</narrative>
  </description>
